# Images: never tracked here. 2026-09-18 this project moved into the PUBLIC
# repository kod-shi-data (GitHub Pages). assets/person/ holds photos of a real
# person and experiments/, runs/ hold hundreds of generated images of her, so
# the old negations that tracked assets/** and experiments/** images were
# removed and every image file was dropped from history on import
# (git filter-repo). The full record with images stays in the original
# repository C:\Users\Admin\Open Source Stylist (its .git, ~405 MB, commit
# 3d51e6d) and, as ignored files, on disk in this folder. Publishing them is
# the owner's decision; then `git add -f` the chosen paths.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.mp4
*.gif

